      "derivation_trace": "乘客到达率与航班到达率的线性投影，β 由机场历史数据校准。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q2"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E4",
      "latex": "P_0 = \\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{c-1}\\frac{(c\\rho)^k}{k!} + \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!(1-\\rho)}\\right)^{-1}",
      "type": "代数",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V5"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "M/M/c 系统空闲概率，是队长与等待时间公式的基础。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q3"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E5",
      "latex": "W_q = \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!c\\mu(1-\\rho)^2} P_0, \\quad L_q = \\lambda W_q",
      "type": "代数",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V1",
        "V6",
        "V7"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "M/M/c 平均等待时间与 Little 定律。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q3"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E6",
      "latex": "G = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}|\\pi_i - \\bar{\\pi}|, \\quad \\pi_i = \\bar{r}_a(d_i) - c_w(T_w^{(i)})",
      "type": "代数",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V12",
        "V15"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "平均绝对离差度量收益均衡，短途优先降低 T_w^{(i)} 从而压缩离差。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q4"
    }
